  "description": "The SNEAK EQ impresses with its outstanding design, fresh colours and elegant features. Highest integration and a striking frame design support both the reduced look and the urban aesthetics of the bike. But the SNEAK EQ is more than just a sporty, fast bike: StVZO-compliant and fully integrated lighting in the handlebar and mudguards make this stylish urban bike suitable for everyday use and ready for any weather. The straight handlebar with 180 degree steering stop offers maximum comfort and intuitive handling for greater road safety. Thanks to the luggage struts on the mudguard, you can easily transport 8 kg of luggage per side. The quality of the bike is obvious from its low overall weight and high-end components. A feather-light carbon fork and high-performance Continental Ride City tyres make the bike a reliable commuter bike for daily routes. With responsive SHIMANO disc brakes and the versatile SHIMANO Cues 6000 shifting system, you'll always find the right gearing for a smooth and efficient ride. ¹approx. 13.6 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for frame colour Chalk, size M, without pedals The system weight is 130 kg.",
